  message: "Done. Merged as PR #1854 (dev e45b60e109). Own-class field types are keyed self.<field> in the per-call type map; Case 2f and the Site-3 own-field exclusion read that key; _prune_shadowed drops a var_types key by its ROOT. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE on merged dev, the premise-check fixtures re-run through analyze_python: b2 (self.conn = Conn(); conn = Other(); self.conn.ping()) -> Conn.ping @0.85, was Other.ping @0.85; a1 / a4 ([self.conn.ping() for conn in items], lambda conn: self.conn.ping()) -> Conn.ping @0.85, was python:external @0.4; a6 -> Conn.ping on both lines. test_py_own_field_namespaced.py: 5 tests, 4 red before (same-named local, comprehension variable, lambda parameter, bare conn not the field); the plain-call reach control green before and after."  # 5b6a
